  "description": "Messaging Gateway SzybkiSMS.pl<br /><br />\nThis package includes Messaging SDK for C# to send SMS and MMS messages directly from your app via <a href=\"https://szybkisms.pl\">https://szybkisms.pl</a> messaging platform.<br /><br />\n*Client* class is used to initialize SDK environment.<br /><br />\nPlease initialize it this way:<br /><br />\n```<br />\nusing Gsmservice.Gateway;<br /><br />\nvar sdk = new Client(bearer: \"YOUR API ACCESS TOKEN\");<br />\n```<br /><br />\nIf you want to use a Sandbox test system please initialize it as follows:<br /><br />\n```<br />\nvar sdk = new Client(bearer: \"YOUR API ACCESS TOKEN\", null, SDKConfig.Server.Sandbox);<br />\n```",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
